9.  INDEPENDENT ABSOLUTE-AMPLITUDE CROSS-CHECK: the HSC stack
==============================================================================

   Chiu+2022 HSC stacked profile, 10 bins, recovered from
   the e-print vector stream by the efeds-hsc lane.  An INDEPENDENT
   instrument with a 98% P(z) source cut, i.e. far less photo-z
   dilution than DECADE's DNF point estimates.  NEVER fitted.

     R[Mpc]    HSC g_+  DECADE g_+        +-  DECADE/HSC
      0.333    0.02434     0.00468   0.00287       0.192
      0.443    0.02426     0.00066   0.00193       0.027
      0.590    0.01988     0.00069   0.00138       0.035
